    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n95365" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκύτη:</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κεφαλή</span>, <i><span class="en">
			Hsch.
		</span></i>; also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκύτα:</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸν τράχηλον, Σικελοί</span>, Id.; freq. in <i><span class="en">
			Hp.
		</span></i> acc. to Psell. ap. <i><span class="en">
			Zonar.
			1
		</span></i> p.cxviii.<i><span class="en">
			8
		</span></i> Tittm.; cited fr. <i><span class="en">
			Hp.
		</span></i> by <i><span class="en">
			Erot.
		</span></i> and expld. as <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>part of
				the neck</i> or <i>spinal marrow</i> or <i>scalp</i>,
			citing <i><span class="en">
				Archil.
				122
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ σκύταλα</span> (leg. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκύτα</span>)<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc"> . . , ὅ
				ἐστι τοὺς τραχήλους</span>, Sch. <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Av.</u>
				1283
			</span></i> (ascribed to <i><span class="en">
				Epich.
			</span></i>(<i><span class="en">
				173a
			</span></i>) by Kaibel <u>CGF</u>p.vii).</div>
